===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈsɪŋkɹə(ʊ)tɹɒn/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|physics}} A form of [[cyclotron]] in which [[charge]]d [[particle]]s are [[accelerate]]d by an [[electric field]] that is [[synchronized]] with a [[magnetic field]] that keeps them in a [[circular]] path.

